senses.gloss:
तिर्यक् ind. Obliquely, crookedly, in a slanting or oblique direction;
 तिर्यगास्थाय संक्रुद्धः पक्षीशे भगवान्हरिः Rām. 7. 7. 41; विलोकयति
 तिर्यक् K. P. 10; Me. 51; Ku. 5. 74;

तीरित + .{@-तम्@}
—1 Completion of any affair.
—2 Non-infliction of a sentence owing to bribery or other unfair means.
